\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {2.2}{\ignorespaces The forward-backward propagation scheme to compute the components of the gradient in Eq.~\eqref  {eq:stgradient}. (a)~Forward propagate the initial state by $U_N\cdots  U_1$ to obtain the realized state $|\psi _N\rangle $ and calculate the overlap $\langle \psi _N|\phi _T\rangle $, where $|\phi _T\rangle $ is the target state. (b)~Backward propagate $|\psi _N\rangle $ and $|\phi _T\rangle $ by the propagators $U_N^\dagger ,U_{N-1}^\dagger ,\cdots  ,U_1^\dagger $ iteratively, and compute $\langle \phi _n|\frac  {\partial U_n }{\partial a_{n}}|\psi _{n-1}\rangle $ at each step.}}{22}{figure.2.2}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:GRAPE}{{2.2}{22}{The forward-backward propagation scheme to compute the components of the gradient in Eq.~\eqref {eq:stgradient}. (a)~Forward propagate the initial state by $U_N\cdots U_1$ to obtain the realized state $\dket {\psi _N}$ and calculate the overlap $\langle \psi _N|\phi _T\rangle $, where $\dket {\phi _T}$ is the target state. (b)~Backward propagate $\dket {\psi _N}$ and $\dket {\phi _T}$ by the propagators $U_N^\dagger ,U_{N-1}^\dagger ,\cdots ,U_1^\dagger $ iteratively, and compute $\dbra {\phi _n}\frac {\partial U_n }{\partial a_{n}}\dket {\psi _{n-1}}$ at each step}{figure.2.2}{}}
\newlabel{fig:GRAPE@cref}{{[figure][2][2]2.2}{[1][21][]22}}
